 ## Overview
-Explicit Radiance Fields (PERF) formulates image-based 3D reconstruction as a non-linear least-squares problem solved explicitly without neural networks [S2]. It represents the scene with a voxel grid for the foreground and a hierarchy of environment maps for the background, optimizing color and opacity values directly via a Gauss-Newton solver [S2]. Unlike [Plenoxels](7440-plenoxels.md) which uses neural networks for view-dependent color, PERF assumes diffuse surfaces and achieves significantly faster convergence by leveraging analytical gradients and iterative linear solvers [S2].
+Explicit Radiance Fields (PERF) formulates image-based 3D reconstruction as a non-linear least-squares problem solved explicitly without neural networks [S2]. It represents the scene with a voxel grid for the foreground and a hierarchy of environment maps for the background, optimizing color and opacity values directly via a Gauss-Newton solver [S2]. Unlike [Plenoxels](7440-plenoxels.md) which uses spherical harmonics for view-dependent color, PERF assumes diffuse surfaces and achieves significantly faster convergence by leveraging analytical gradients and iterative linear solvers [S2, S1].
 
